[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11702.07, "timestamp": "03:15:02", "text": "恶魔？如何？恶魔长什么样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11704.15, "timestamp": "03:15:04", "text": "相信我，当你……的时候，你就会知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11706.63, "timestamp": "03:15:06", "text": "看看吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11709.59, "timestamp": "03:15:09", "text": "哦，安娜哭了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11711.429, "timestamp": "03:15:11", "text": "哦，她正在经历这一切。好吧，她是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11713.91, "timestamp": "03:15:13", "text": "正在经历这一切。你知道，她就是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11715.99, "timestamp": "03:15:15", "text": "对她来说，这是一段非常情绪化的时期。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11717.99, "timestamp": "03:15:17", "text": "你知道，我们会给她一些空间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11719.99, "timestamp": "03:15:19", "text": "我们给她一些空间。我应该把东西放在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11723.11, "timestamp": "03:15:23", "text": "汽油罐？外部。呃，你知道，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11725.51, "timestamp": "03:15:25", "text": "知道烧烤店在哪里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11735.91, "timestamp": "03:15:35", "text": "好了，各位。是的。是的。如果你们需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11740.309, "timestamp": "03:15:40", "text": "呃，我有一把共用卧室的钥匙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11742.87, "timestamp": "03:15:42", "text": "好的。凉爽的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11745.349, "timestamp": "03:15:45", "text": "我听到的声音就像南瓜离开了一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11747.429, "timestamp": "03:15:47", "text": "没错，兄弟。是的，有很多"}]